            <ArticleTitle>The use of topical opioids to relieve pressure ulcer pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>90-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article provides an overview of the use of topical opioids to relieve pain associated with pressure ulcers in patients receiving palliative care. Morphine and diamorphine-infused gel have been used effectively to relieve pain and promote comfort in this group of patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
